			"Message": "docs(Worker): Document complete changelog history from 0.0.1 to 0.5.0\n\nConverted minimal CHANGELOG entry to comprehensive Keep a Changelog format documenting all changes across five releases. Added version entries for 0.1.0 through 0.5.0 with detailed Added, Changed, and Fixed sections covering web worker implementation, service worker infrastructure, ESBuild configuration, dependency updates, security fixes, and architecture documentation.\n\nThis provides a complete historical record of the Worker element's evolution since its initial service worker infrastructure.",
